{
    "title": "Webull: Investing & Trading",
    "description": "Webull offers all the investing products you need - stocks, ETFs, options, futures, and more\u2014no matter your experience level. Earn 4.25% on your uninvested cash.\r\n\r\nTRADE WITH $0 COMMISSION FEES\r\n- Trade stocks, ETFs, and options commission-free, plus no contract fees on equity options*.\r\n- Invest what you can afford with fractional shares - start with as little as $5.\r\n- Buy and sell foreign stocks in the OTC markets in real-time.\r\n\r\nBE INVESTED IN YOUR RETIREMENT\r\n- Earn 4.25% APY on your free cash**, no fees or minimum, FDIC insured.\r\n- Trade and invest in stocks, ETFs, and options, all commission-free in the same IRA.\r\n\r\nTRADE FUTURES FOR LESS\r\n- Trade micro, mini, and regular futures contracts at only $0.25, $0.70, and $1.25, respectively.\r\n- With intraday margins for popular contracts as low as 7-10%.\r\n\r\nINVEST WITH TECH BUILT FOR YOU\r\n- Customized by you and managed by pros - one-click to automate your investing.\r\n- Rebalance your portfolio and reinvest dividends automatically.\r\n- Set up recurring investments on your preferred schedule.\r\n\r\nAWARD-WINNING PLATFORM WITH EASY-TO-USE TOOLS\r\n- Award-winning platforms built for beginners to seasoned investors, allowing you to trade via mobile, web, and desktop.\r\n- Explore in-depth analysis and advanced charting. 60+ technical indicators and 17+ charting tools can help you analyze trends and decipher market information.\r\n- Practice & explore trading methods without spending real money using Paper Trading.\r\n\r\nDISCLOSURES\r\nSecurities trading is offered to self-directed customers by Webull Financial LLC, a broker dealer registered with the Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC). Webull Financial LLC is a member of the Financial Industry Regulatory Authority (FINRA), Securities Investor Protection Corporation (SIPC). Webull is not a bank. Rates subject to change. More info: www.webull.com/disclosures\r\n\r\nFree trading of stocks, ETFs, and options refers to $0 commissions for Webull Financial LLC self-directed individual cash or margin brokerage accounts and IRAs that trade U.S. listed securities via mobile devices, desktop or website products. Relevant regulatory and exchange fees may apply. Please refer to our Fee Schedule for more details.\r\n\r\nAdvisory accounts and services are provided by Webull Advisors LLC (also known as \"Webull Advisors\"). Webull Advisors is an Investment Advisor registered with and regulated by the SEC under the Investment Advisors Act of 1940. Registration does not imply a level of skill or training. See additional information on the Disclosures webpage. Trades in your Webull Advisors account are executed by Webull Financial LLC. That means your assets are protected up to $500,000 in value, including $250,000 in any cash awaiting reinvestment.\r\n\r\nOptions trading entails significant risk and is not appropriate for all investors. Option investors can rapidly lose the value of their investment in a short period of time and incur permanent loss by expiration date. Losses can potentially exceed the initial required deposit. You need to complete an options trading application and get approval on eligible accounts. Please read the Characteristics and Risks of Standardized Options before trading options. *A $0.55 per contract fee applies for certain index options and a $0.10 per contract fee applies for oversized option orders.\r\n\r\nWebull Financial LLC is a CFTC registered Futures Commission Merchant and NFA Member. Please note futures trading involves substantial risk and is not suitable for all investors. Please read the FCM Risk Disclosure statement prior to signing up for Futures Trading. More info: www.webull.com/policy\r\n\r\n**Eligibility for Webull's Cash Management Program limited to self-directed accounts.\r\n\r\nAddress: 44 Wall Street, Ste 501, New York, NY 10005, United States.\r\nEmail: customerservices@webull.us",
    "descriptionHTML": "Webull offers all the investing products you need - stocks, ETFs, options, futures, and more\u2014no matter your experience level. Earn 4.25% on your uninvested cash.<br><br>TRADE WITH $0 COMMISSION FEES<br>- Trade stocks, ETFs, and options commission-free, plus no contract fees on equity options*.<br>- Invest what you can afford with fractional shares - start with as little as $5.<br>- Buy and sell foreign stocks in the OTC markets in real-time.<br><br>BE INVESTED IN YOUR RETIREMENT<br>- Earn 4.25% APY on your free cash**, no fees or minimum, FDIC insured.<br>- Trade and invest in stocks, ETFs, and options, all commission-free in the same IRA.<br><br>TRADE FUTURES FOR LESS<br>- Trade micro, mini, and regular futures contracts at only $0.25, $0.70, and $1.25, respectively.<br>- With intraday margins for popular contracts as low as 7-10%.<br><br>INVEST WITH TECH BUILT FOR YOU<br>- Customized by you and managed by pros - one-click to automate your investing.<br>- Rebalance your portfolio and reinvest dividends automatically.<br>- Set up recurring investments on your preferred schedule.<br><br>AWARD-WINNING PLATFORM WITH EASY-TO-USE TOOLS<br>- Award-winning platforms built for beginners to seasoned investors, allowing you to trade via mobile, web, and desktop.<br>- Explore in-depth analysis and advanced charting. 60+ technical indicators and 17+ charting tools can help you analyze trends and decipher market information.<br>- Practice &amp; explore trading methods without spending real money using Paper Trading.<br><br>DISCLOSURES<br>Securities trading is offered to self-directed customers by Webull Financial LLC, a broker dealer registered with the Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC). Webull Financial LLC is a member of the Financial Industry Regulatory Authority (FINRA), Securities Investor Protection Corporation (SIPC). Webull is not a bank. Rates subject to change. More info: www.webull.com/disclosures<br><br>Free trading of stocks, ETFs, and options refers to $0 commissions for Webull Financial LLC self-directed individual cash or margin brokerage accounts and IRAs that trade U.S. listed securities via mobile devices, desktop or website products. Relevant regulatory and exchange fees may apply. Please refer to our Fee Schedule for more details.<br><br>Advisory accounts and services are provided by Webull Advisors LLC (also known as &quot;Webull Advisors&quot;). Webull Advisors is an Investment Advisor registered with and regulated by the SEC under the Investment Advisors Act of 1940. Registration does not imply a level of skill or training. See additional information on the Disclosures webpage. Trades in your Webull Advisors account are executed by Webull Financial LLC. That means your assets are protected up to $500,000 in value, including $250,000 in any cash awaiting reinvestment.<br><br>Options trading entails significant risk and is not appropriate for all investors. Option investors can rapidly lose the value of their investment in a short period of time and incur permanent loss by expiration date. Losses can potentially exceed the initial required deposit. You need to complete an options trading application and get approval on eligible accounts. Please read the Characteristics and Risks of Standardized Options before trading options. *A $0.55 per contract fee applies for certain index options and a $0.10 per contract fee applies for oversized option orders.<br><br>Webull Financial LLC is a CFTC registered Futures Commission Merchant and NFA Member. Please note futures trading involves substantial risk and is not suitable for all investors. Please read the FCM Risk Disclosure statement prior to signing up for Futures Trading. More info: www.webull.com/policy<br><br>**Eligibility for Webull&#39;s Cash Management Program limited to self-directed accounts.<br><br>Address: 44 Wall Street, Ste 501, New York, NY 10005, United States.<br>Email: customerservices@webull.us",
